Tealeaf is an independently maintained fork. Local changes include source
formatting, TeaVM interoperability corrections, callback removal, native
namespaces and primitive boundaries, Leaflet API additions, custom markers,
SVG/video overlays, animated navigation, runtime resource loading and a showcase.
Modified inherited source files carry a modification notice and retain their
original notices. Build-time source adaptation may make additional changes.

The module LICENSE retains the gwty-leaflet Apache 2.0 license text and its
G-Widgets copyright appendix. The repository root LICENSE retains the inherited
Apache 2.0 text with its Dominokit copyright appendix. That inherited attribution
has not been replaced with a claim of ownership by Tealeaf.

